ortfolio Target"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, aim for 5 substantial engineering projects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Three-phase power-system analysis"},{"text":"Electrical machine/motor-control project"},{"text":"Power-electronics converter"},{"text":"Solar + battery energy system"},{"text":"Smart microgrid / energy-management capstone"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest capstone should demonstrate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Electrical Requirements","System Architecture","Calculations","Simulation","Equipment Selection","Protection","Control","Monitoring","Technical Documentation"]},{"type":"p","text":"This keeps the roadmap broad enough for the general Electrical Engineer role while creating clear routes into power systems, power electronics, automation, renewable energy and EV engineering."}]}]}